336","created_at":"2026-11-07T04:59:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118931384660377992"],"id":"2118931384660377992","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2636,"like_count":87,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":8},"text":"狗不会说人话而人却会狗叫这是否公平","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118931384660377992"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-07T04:34:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118925095129514091"],"id":"2118925095129514091","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":433,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"玻璃女神跟我互关了还给我打了米米，今天是最幸福的一天TT我真的哭了，好幸福好幸福@six919303018180 https://t.co/krTQAQ5SlQ","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118925095129514091"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-07T02:35:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118895082397131127"],"id":"2118895082397131127","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":763,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的生活有一种受伤后躺路边打120自救结果被赶来的救护车碾死的黑色幽默","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118895082397131127"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-07T02:35:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118894961194398009"],"id":"2118894961194398009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":982,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"没人陪的日子里没有在聊骚没有在幸福只是摘下眼镜抹一把脸叹气","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118894961194398009"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:29:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118742635397660891"],"id":"2118742635397660891","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":661,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看到这个又很想哭🥲…… https://t.co/qtlYND4KMM","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118742635397660891"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:28:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118742273651626369"],"id":"2118742273651626369","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":994,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"没有故意消极，正常人住在我家一天就能写出二十万字我这种文字，没开玩笑。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118742273651626369"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:26:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118741792418054435"],"id":"2118741792418054435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1276,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"朋友总是喜欢和我坐在一起消磨时间，什么也不做只是并排发呆，起初我觉得在这里跟我荒度时间没有任何意义，为什么不去做些更有意义的事情至少不是发呆，后来才发现，和舒服的人坐在一起浪费一整个下午的意义就是让自己感到幸福","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118741792418054435"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:23:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118741004396412955"],"id":"2118741004396412955","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1216,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"text":"因为被很用力地爱过，所以更怕被遗忘。因为害怕被遗忘，所以干脆先消失好了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118741004396412955"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:20:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118740195281617335"],"id":"2118740195281617335","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1736,"like_count":40,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"今年我不快乐但在硬撑，我真的好累了，真的。其实有时候还依然能感受到幸福，甚至怀疑自己是不是双相了，我本身就是个矛盾又分裂的人，得几个心理疾病一点也不奇怪，但问题就是我知道我没病，就算病了我也可以自愈。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118740195281617335"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:16:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118739383105061100"],"id":"2118739383105061100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":2213,"like_count":72,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":5},"text":"你不应该骗我，你应该许诺我一个虚无缥缈的未来，所有的答案你都说也许可能大概，你把改天说得像真的，把以后说得像承诺，把看情况说得像誓言。最模糊的话语带给我的伤害最清晰，清晰得像把刀，捅在我自以为最安全的地方。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118739383105061100"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:16:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118739259700187321"],"id":"2118739259700187321","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":730,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你对我的态度总是模棱两可，所以我就傻乎乎地为你做任何事，仅仅只是为了换你一个明确的回应","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118739259700187321"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:08:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118737270350196796"],"id":"2118737270350196796","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1353,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"后来我不得不承认，有过一段感情的阴影，会影响接下来遇到的所有人，安全感这东西一旦炸裂，你会觉得所有人都是带刀而来","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118737270350196796"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:07:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118737078989242451"],"id":"2118737078989242451","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2420,"like_count":124,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":10},"text":"感谢世界还有文学，感谢文字接住了我那颗始终悬坠的心，是的，我一直很喜欢那种犀利的语言。我始终觉得他们的文字像一把利剑，它能剖开人们心中的想法，使那些龌龊的心思，赤裸裸的暴露在人们眼前。简直无处可躲","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118737078989242451"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:06:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118736665867129100"],"id":"2118736665867129100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":7596,"like_count":209,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":13},"text":"好可爱的重力男 https://t.co/DLOjZlU88h","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118736665867129100"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-06T15:32:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118728194052497791"],"id":"2118728194052497791","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":9293,"like_count":300,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":47},"text":"和你卖萌只是开开玩笑你知道吧？希望你不要忘记我最大的心愿是操飞你","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2118728194052